    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">International Counterproliferation Program (ICP): Counterproliferation Awareness (CPA) Virtual Course</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">This Counterproliferation Awareness course was delivered virtually to six senior-level law enforcement officials from the Royal Brunei Police Force. The course provided a basic understanding of weapons of mass destruction (WMD) proliferation issues specific to the region and inspire interagency and international cooperation.</narrative>
    </description>
