    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">International Counterproliferation Program (ICP): Brunei - Countering WMD in the Maritime Environment</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Training to educate customs, border guard, maritime law enforcement, and security participants about the potential of WMD movement through maritime ports and to provide an overview of the various methods used to detect and deter such movement.</narrative>
